  <div class="rounded-xl border-2 border-purple-300 p-5 pr-28 max-sm:pr-5 bg-white relative shadow-sm">
    <div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-20 h-20 bg-purple-400 rounded-bl-2xl rounded-tr-xl flex items-center justify-center text-white max-sm:hidden">&#x1f4d6;</div>
    <p class="adt-body italic leading-relaxed text-slate-700"><span data-id="pg103_n0016">Kosova ka nj&#xeb; trash&#xeb;gimi kulturore t&#xeb; larmishme, e cila e b&#xeb;n nj&#xeb; vend t&#xeb;rheq&#xeb;s p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; vizitor&#xeb;t.</span> <span data-id="pg103_n0017">&#xc7;do pjes&#xeb; e Kosov&#xeb;s ka nj&#xeb; trash&#xeb;gimi t&#xeb; pasur materiale me qendra arkeologjike, parqe natyrore, kala, kulla, monumente fetare, galeri t&#xeb; artit, rrug&#xeb; t&#xeb; ngushta me kalldr&#xeb;m, shat&#xeb;rvan&#xeb;, muze, sht&#xeb;pi t&#xeb; vjetra e objekte t&#xeb; tjera.</span></p>
    <p class="adt-body italic leading-relaxed text-slate-700 mt-3"><span data-id="pg103_n0019">Kosova ka 7 muze aktiv&#xeb;, n&#xeb; t&#xeb; cil&#xeb;t ruhen shum&#xeb; monumente kulturore q&#xeb; tregojn&#xeb; p&#xeb;r historin&#xeb; e popullit ton&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id="pg103_n0020">Nd&#xeb;r ta, vlen t&#xeb; theksohet Muzeu Historik Komb&#xeb;tar, Muzeu Etnologjik &#x201c;Emin Gjiku&#x201d;, Muzeu i Prizrenit, i cili fillimisht ka funksionuar si banj&#xeb; turke.</span> <span data-id="pg103_n0021">Po ashtu, Kosova ka edhe Kompleksin Memorial &quot;Adem Jashari&#x201d;.</span></p>
    <p class="adt-body italic leading-relaxed text-slate-700 mt-3"><span data-id="pg103_n0023">N&#xeb; Kosov&#xeb; ka edhe shum&#xeb; monumente t&#xeb; tjera.</span> <span data-id="pg103_n0024">Shumica e monumenteve jan&#xeb; manastire, k&#xeb;shtjella, kisha dhe xhami.</span> <span data-id="pg103_n0025">Nd&#xeb;r objektet arkeologjike vlen t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rmendet qyteti i lasht&#xeb; i Ulpian&#xeb;s.</span> <span data-id="pg103_n0026">Gjithashtu, kemi Manastirin e De&#xe7;anit dhe Sht&#xeb;pin&#xeb; e Lidhjes s&#xeb; Prizrenit q&#xeb; p&#xeb;rb&#xeb;het nga kat&#xeb;r godina.</span></p>
    <p class="adt-body italic leading-relaxed text-slate-700 mt-3"><span data-id="pg103_n0028">T&#xeb; gjitha k&#xeb;to objekte i takojn&#xeb; trash&#xeb;gimis&#xeb; kulturore materiale.</span> <span data-id="pg103_n0029">K&#xeb;to objekte mbrohen me Ligjin p&#xeb;r Trash&#xeb;gimin&#xeb; Kulturore.</span></p>
    <p class="adt-body italic leading-relaxed text-slate-700 mt-3"><span data-id="pg103_n0031">Trash&#xeb;gimia kulturore jomateriale p&#xeb;rfshin gjuh&#xeb;n, krijimtarit&#xeb; popullore, t&#xeb; cilat jan&#xeb; ruajtur dhe p&#xeb;rcjell&#xeb; nd&#xeb;r breza.</span></p>
    <p class="adt-body italic leading-relaxed text-slate-700 mt-3"><span data-id="pg103_n0033">Nj&#xeb; vend t&#xeb; ve&#xe7;ant&#xeb; n&#xeb; trash&#xeb;gimin&#xeb; kulturore t&#xeb; vendit ton&#xeb; z&#xeb;n&#xeb; edhe veshjet dhe ushqimet tradicionale.</span></p>
